          AI power &amp; grid ??? concentration lens
        </p>
        <h2 className="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          Top-1 holds {HEADLINE.top1Share2024Pct}% ?? Top-3 holds{" "}
          {HEADLINE.top3Share2024Pct}%
